  "body": "Step straight into effortless coastal living with this newly built, light-filled townhouse in the heart of Stanmore Bay. Designed across three spacious levels, this low-maintenance home offers the perfect blend of contemporary style, flexible living, and lock-up-and-leave convenience.\r\n\r\nBuilt with modern lifestyles in mind, the versatile floor plan features three generous bedrooms and three bathrooms, including two ensuites. It's an ideal setup for growing families, hosting guests, accommodating flatmates to help with the mortgage, or creating a comfortable multi-generational living arrangement.\r\n\r\nThe main living level boasts a bright, open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area that flows seamlessly onto a sunny, private deck. It's the perfect setting for your morning coffee or evening drinks with family and friends.\r\n\r\nLocation Highlights: Situated in a quiet, thriving neighbourhood, you'll be just moments from the Hibiscus Coast Community RSA, Stanmore Bay Beach, local cafés, shopping centres, Stanmore Bay School, and picturesque parks. You'll also have the opportunity to experience the area's stunning seasonal bioluminescence along the coastline.\r\n\r\nWith a highly motivated vendor ready to sell, this brand-new home presents an outstanding opportunity to secure your place in one of the Hibiscus Coast's most sought-after seaside communities.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing or visit one of our open homes!",
